-## 7. Third-Party Services
+## 6. Data Security
 
-lilvro integrates the following third-party services:
+- Voice audio never leaves the device.
+- All API calls to OpenRouter and Deepgram are made over HTTPS with API key authentication.
+- API keys are stored in environment variables and never exposed in the codebase or to the student.
+- No database, cloud storage, or logging infrastructure is used by lilvro itself.
 
-- **OpenRouter** (openrouter.ai) — Language model inference. Governed by OpenRouter's Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.
-- **Deepgram** (deepgram.com) — Text-to-speech synthesis. Governed by Deepgram's Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.
-
-We are not responsible for the data practices of these third parties. We encourage parents to review their policies.
